{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And they encamped in the wilderness of Paran.</b> According to the opinion of the majority, the cloud was there, because it is found: \"and the cloud abode in the wilderness of Paran,\" and they explained: \"the cloud departed from over the Tent\" — according to its plain meaning. But in my opinion this interpretation is not correct."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:17:26.332758554Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}